pe="ppub"><day>14</day><month>8</month><year>2006</year></pub-date><volume>174</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>605</fpage><lpage>605</lpage><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2006, The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2006</copyright-year><self-uri xlink:title="pdf" xlink:href="jcb1740605.pdf"/></article-meta></front><body><p>Vol. 174 No. 2, July 17, 2006. Pages <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="174" page="231" id="N0x3380790N0x39bf5c0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="16831885" ext-link-type="pubmed">231&#x02013;243</related-article>.</p><p>In the original paper, the top left (Control) and top middle (Treated) panels under the &#x0201c;120 days&#x0201d; heading of <xref rid="fig9" ref-type="fig">Fig. 9 B</xref> were duplicated. The corrected panels appear below.</p><fig position="anchor" id="fig9"><label>Figure 9</label><graphic xlink:href="jcb1740605f01"></graphic></fig></body></article>